      ],
      "trigger": "The writer appends a newline. Android marker reading uses command(), whose stdout.trim() removes that byte. The actual app hashes File.text() including the newline. Cleanup hashes the trimmed bytes into visibilityRequestMd5. validatePreReconnectServiceBaseline line37 rejects the three actual raw marker MD5 observations.",
      "effect": "Android pre-reconnect cleanup cannot produce a valid finished receipt or continue the authorized service exercise from it. iOS uses readFileSync and retains bytes.",
      "requestedFix": "Keep raw marker output unchanged; retain trimmed scalar command results. Add a regression executing the actual command/read transport through a mocked adb process.",
